homelab-borg-service-backup-client (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Renamed from homelab-borg-service-backup, split out of it as its own
    independent source package with its own versioning. Server-side
    setup (installing borg, creating the borgbackup user/group and
    backup directory, and client enrollment) moved to the new, separate
    homelab-borg-service-backup-server package. install.sh's SSH trust
    setup now just prints the enroll command for an administrator to
    run on the server, instead of SSHing into it as a sudo-capable
    admin account.

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Sun, 16 Aug 2026 23:00:00 -0500

