homelab-borg-service-backup (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaged release: classic borg (not borg2), auto-generated
    per-host repokey passphrases with key escrow export, restore/
    list-archives subcommands, admin recovery SSH key for disaster
    recovery, and Debian packaging.

